    "After pairing, run these on the same Hermes profile. First confirm the local relay credential, then send a test. You should receive the test notification on this iPhone within a few seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配对完成后，请在同一个 Hermes 档案上执行这些步骤。先确认本地中继凭据，然后发送测试。几秒内应能在这台 iPhone 上收到测试通知。"
