          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit could not connect to the dashboard at this address. Make sure the dashboard is running and that this device can reach it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 无法连接到该地址上的仪表盘。请确认仪表盘正在运行，且本设备可以访问它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit could not establish a secure connection to the dashboard. The server’s TLS certificate may be misconfigured." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 无法与仪表盘建立安全连接。服务器的 TLS 证书可能配置有误。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit could not find that host. Check the dashboard address and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 找不到该主机。请检查仪表盘地址后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit is ready when you are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 随时待命。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit needs you to sign in to the dashboard to reconnect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 需要你先登录仪表盘才能重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit never installs or configures Tailscale, and it doesn’t assume an address or port — Hermes tells you what to use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 不会安装或配置 Tailscale，也不会预设地址或端口——Hermes 会告诉你该用什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit opens to the session list. Used if you dismiss it without choosing another conversation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 将打开会话列表。在未选择其他对话的情况下关闭列表时使用。"
          }
