    },
    "Conduit profile" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 档案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit reached the server, but iOS does not trust its TLS certificate. If you use your own certificate authority, make sure its root certificate is installed and trusted on this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 已连上服务器，但 iOS 不信任其 TLS 证书。如果你使用自己的证书颁发机构，请确保其根证书已安装并受此设备信任。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit will check the dashboard address and try your credentials now. Nothing is saved, and Conduit won’t connect yet — you’ll confirm everything on the Review screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 现在会检查仪表盘地址并尝试你的凭据。不会保存任何内容，Conduit 也尚未连接——你将在「审核」页确认所有信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit will not ask you to expose a raw public port, create firewall rules, or bypass certificate checks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 不会要求你暴露原始公网端口、创建防火墙规则或绕过证书检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit-generated vibration feedback for actions and response progress. iOS system controls can still provide their own feedback." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由 Conduit 为操作与回复进度生成的振动反馈。iOS 系统控件仍可能提供自己的反馈。"
          }
        }
