    },
    "Phrases you can say during a Voice conversation. A phrase matches only when it is the entire spoken utterance — the same words inside a longer sentence do nothing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在语音对话中可以说出的短语。只有当整句话恰好是该短语时才会匹配——较长句子中出现相同字词不会触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick how Conduit should reach your self-hosted Hermes dashboard. You can change this later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
